are simply the standard form parameters of the hyperbola, and the sum \\(h + k + a + b\\) is derived directly from the algebraic structure of the hyperbola without needing to delve into the specific values of \\(a\\) and \\(b\\). Thus, the correct answer is:\n\\[h + k + a + b = -1.\\]\n\nTherefore, the correct final answer is:\n\\[\\boxed{-1}.\\]",
